Package: fastspacexr
Type: Package
Title: fastspacexr: a faster drop-in build of spacexr (RCTD and C-SIDE for spatial transcriptomics)
Version: 2.2.1
Author: Dylan Cable (original spacexr); Alexander Ling (fastspacexr modifications)
Maintainer: Alexander Ling <alling@bwh.harvard.edu>
Description: fastspacexr is a performance fork of spacexr 2.2.1 (https://github.com/dmcable/spacexr). It is intended to behave, as
    close as we could manage, the same as spacexr 2.2.1 -- same functions, arguments and model -- but faster: compiled per-pixel
    solvers and process-level parallelism. The original package's description follows. Cell type identification and cell
    type-specific differential expression for spatial transcriptomics.
URL: https://github.com/Alexander-Ling/fast-spacexr
BugReports: https://github.com/Alexander-Ling/fast-spacexr/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
License: GNU General Public License v3.0.
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
